  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Luo Po Valley, Qin Bai Sheng lures him in as a friend and presses him to join an attack on Lang Ya blessed land. Hui Feng Zi refuses, arguing that wind escape cannot penetrate blessed lands or grotto-heavens, then strikes with death wind flying blade. Qin Bai Sheng’s defense holds. When Hui Feng Zi turns into wind and flies for the valley sky, a Gu formation knocks him out of that state. He joins the Lang Ya attack after a few breaths. The same movement method once let him escape pursuit by the rank eight Gu Immortal Yao Huang.",
      "chapters": [
        779
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_luo_po_valley",
        "char_qin_bai_sheng",
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "move_wind_escape",
        "sys_gu_formation",
        "fac_lang_ya_sect",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_yao_huang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is dressed in a green robe.",
      "chapters": [
        779
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Qin Bai Sheng orders Hui Feng Zi and He Lang Zi to the place where Xue Song Zi died. Hui Feng Zi scouts for traps, then reads the mushed corpse as the work of a powerful strength path killer move.",
      "chapters": [
        875
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cloud-building-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_he_lang_zi",
        "char_xue_song_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan comes out as Xing Xiang Zi, Hui Feng Zi and He Lang Zi watch him as demonic path immortals; Hui Feng Zi tells He Lang Zi to attack while he assists from the side.",
      "chapters": [
        876
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cloud-building-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He later casts wind escape, reappears outside the cloud building, and cuts it with death wind flying blade. Fang Yuan recognizes the movement move and names him Hui Feng Zi.",
      "chapters": [
        877
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cloud-building-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan’s amplified strength path giant hands slam down, Hui Feng Zi casts wind escape and flees. After he gets clear, he looks back and is counted among the fastest in Northern Plains.",
      "chapters": [
        885
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lang-ya-escape",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Shadow Sect abandons Lang Ya blessed land and returns to defend, he is listed on that defending side with Qin Bai Sheng, Fairy Jiang Yu, and He Lang Zi.",
      "chapters": [
        886
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "return-to-defend",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "char_fairy_jiang_yu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "During the breakout he casts wind escape and pulls ahead of Jiang Yu’s group. Central Continent Gu Immortals admit he is the fastest in Northern Plains, but Chen Zhen Chi and Bu Fei Yan together with a periphery Gu formation slow him until he cannot shake them. After He Lang Zi dies, Hui Feng Zi loses as well, surrenders at the moment before death, and hands over his Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        925
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hundred-days-battle",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent",
        "char_chen_zhen_chi",
        "char_bu_fei_yan",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The ten great ancient sects subdue him and leave him behind to keep watch over Luo Po Valley while their own Gu Immortals return. He reports to Prince Feng Xian when others enter, and he remains on watch over leftover blessed lands after that visit.",
      "chapters": [
        953
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "luo-po-valley-watch",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_prince_feng_xian"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Restricted by Central Continent arrangements on his body, Hui Feng Zi has to stop anyone from taking Luo Po Valley. Fang Yuan appears as Feng Jiu Ge. Hui Feng Zi investigates, confirms the identity, greets him as a subordinate, and guards him while Fang Yuan stores the valley. Fang Yuan then tells him to keep watching the leftover blessed lands. Hui Feng Zi later sends word to the other nine of the ten great ancient sects because Feng Jiu Ge belongs to Spirit Affinity House.",
      "chapters": [
        992
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "feng-jiu-ge-ruse",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "fac_spirit_affinity_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Prince Feng Xian later learns Luo Po Valley slipped away on his watch and calls him negligent, saying he should be punished for it.",
      "chapters": [
        993
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "feng-jiu-ge-ruse",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At the attack on Iron Eagle blessed land, narration names him a demonic path rank seven wind path expert, publicly the fastest person in Northern Plains, whom even Yao Huang could not stop. It also states that he first joined Shadow Sect, then submitted to Heavenly Court, and that this traitor identity had not been exposed yet. He moves through the nests like wind; Meng Ji blames him for a nest Hui Feng Zi did not touch.",
      "chapters": [
        1108
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hidden-defection",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_iron_eagle_blessed_land",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "char_meng_ji"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Heavenly Lord Bai Zu holds the field, Hui Feng Zi laughs, leaves on the wind, and is paired with Chu Du as the two who refuse to give that rank eight face. Yao Huang’s failed capture remains Hui Feng Zi’s proudest achievement.",
      "chapters": [
        1110
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hidden-defection",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_heavenly_lord_bai_zu",
        "char_chu_du"
      ]
    }
  ],
